{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013XSu8zNg5S3A8GgS1feAiT","type":"tool_result","content":"Yes. The webdriverio provider was removed. The release lists \"Remove webdriverio package\" as a breaking change (#10675).\n\nPlaywright was not removed. It appears only in bug fixes: one addresses orphaned Playwright routes when a module is mocked under multiple IDs, and another triggers Playwright/Chromium garbage collection when disk space is low. The page doesn't mention the preview provider."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75bac7c1-0a3b-4687-b934-efbe57d13783","uuid":"b352472b-c102-4134-8794-d3c9303dfe79","timestamp":"2026-10-08T12:39:21.578Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":451736,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"Yes. The webdriverio provider was removed. The release lists \"Remove webdriverio package\" as a breaking change (#10675).\n\nPlaywright was not removed. It appears only in bug fixes: one addresses orphaned Playwright routes when a module is mocked under multiple IDs, and another triggers Playwright/Chromium garbage collection when disk space is low. The page doesn't mention the preview provider.","durationMs":5837,"url":"https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/releases/tag/v5.0.0"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013XSu8zNg5S3A8GgS1feAiT","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
