{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfpnT2x64UM4tMUAFZ1Cq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before Vitest 5, browser mode had three providers: **Playwright** (`@vitest/browser-playwright`), **WebdriverIO** (`@vitest/browser-webdriverio`) and **preview** (`@vitest/browser-preview`). Preview opens your real browser but can't run headless or in CI.\n\n**Vitest 5.0.0 removed the WebdriverIO package**, which is listed as a breaking change (#10675) in the release notes. That leaves Playwright as the main provider; the release only mentions it in bug fixes. The notes don't mention the preview provider, so I'm assuming it's unchanged rather than confirmed. If you're on Vitest 5 and use WebdriverIO, you'll need to move to Playwright.\n\nSources:\n- [Vitest v5.0.0 release notes](https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/releases/tag/v5.0.0)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":407,"cache_read_input_tokens":5386,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":407},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75bac7c1-0a3b-4687-b934-efbe57d13783","uuid":"77184744-acc5-4fd2-b961-a8f4a2a33f77","timestamp":"2026-10-08T12:39:26.117Z","request_id":"req_011CfpnT2dk1FdSCAKxafCmm"}
